---
import Simple from "../layouts/Simple.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../links.ts";
---

<Simple
  title="Privacy"
  eyebrow="Privacy"
  heading="What this site keeps about you"
  lead="Very little. There are no trackers, analytics, cookies or third-party scripts on relationshiposcrm.com."
  description="What relationshiposcrm.com stores when you join the waitlist, and how to have it deleted."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>The waitlist</h2>
    <p>
      When you join the waitlist we store your email address, the team size if you chose one, and
      when you signed up. We use it to email you once, when the hosted version opens. We don't add
      you to a newsletter and we don't share it with anyone.
    </p>
    <h2>Requests to the site</h2>
    <p>
      The site runs on Cloudflare, which handles every request to it. To stop form spam we count
      submissions per IP address for a minute. We don't store your IP address with your signup.
    </p>
    <h2>Deleting your details</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> from the address you signed up with
      and we'll delete it.
    </p>
  </div>
</Simple>
